{
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Act 8: May 1968",
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "s09b01",
     "shot": "nanterre",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "In the spring of 1968, students at Nanterre,",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [],
     "amb": "birds"
    },
    {
     "id": "s09b02",
     "shot": "nanterre",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "a university outside Paris, were angry about plenty of things,",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [],
     "amb": "birds"
    },
    {
     "id": "s09b03",
     "shot": "nanterre",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "including rules that banned men and women from visiting each other's rooms.",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:banned",
       0.5
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "birds"
    },
    {
     "id": "s09b04",
     "shot": "closed",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The authorities closed the campus.",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "slam",
       "w:closed",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s09b05",
     "shot": "sorbonne",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Protests spread to the Sorbonne in the centre of Paris.",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "rumble",
       4,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s09b06",
     "shot": "barricades68",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "On the night of 10 May, barricades went up across the Latin Quarter,",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "rumble",
       0,
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "camp"
    },
    {
     "id": "s09b07",
     "shot": "barricades68",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "police charged, hundreds were injured, and public sympathy swung toward the students.",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "creak",
       "w:sympathy",
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "camp"
    },
    {
     "id": "s09b08",
     "shot": "strike_map",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Then the workers joined.",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pops",
       "w:joined.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s09b09",
     "shot": "strike_map",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "A one-day strike on 13 May became an open-ended one.",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "machine",
       0,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s09b10",
     "shot": "strike_map",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "By late May around ten million workers, roughly two thirds of the French workforce, were on strike.",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ticks",
       4,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s09b11",
     "shot": "strike_map",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Factories, trains, even broadcasting.",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "hit",
       "w:Factories,",
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "hit",
       "w:trains,",
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "hit",
       "w:broadcasting.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s09b12",
     "shot": "strike_map",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The country stopped.",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "deflate",
       "w:stopped.",
       0.5
      ]
     ],
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s09b13",
     "shot": "vanished",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Then on 29 May, de Gaulle vanished.",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "whoosh",
       "w:vanished.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s09b14",
     "shot": "vanished",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "For hours, nobody knew where the president of France was.",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ticks",
       4,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s09b15",
     "shot": "baden",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "He had flown to Baden-Baden in Germany to see the general commanding French forces",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "whoosh",
       8,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s09b16",
     "shot": "baden",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "there, widely understood as a check that the army was behind him.",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s09b17",
     "shot": "landslide",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The next day he came back, announced elections,",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s09b18",
     "shot": "landslide",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "and in June his supporters won a landslide.",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "kaching",
       "w:landslide.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s09b19",
     "shot": "landslide",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The unions got a deal too, with the minimum wage jumping by around 35 percent.",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "coins",
       "w:jumping",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s09b20",
     "shot": "pattern",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "That's the French pattern worth remembering.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s09b21",
     "shot": "pattern",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "A movement that looked like a revolution ended with a pay rise and a",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:pay",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s09b22",
     "shot": "pattern",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "landslide for the government.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:landslide",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s09b23",
     "shot": "resign69",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "De Gaulle himself resigned less than a year later, after losing a referendum.",
     "date": 1969,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:referendum.",
       0.5
      ],
      [
       "steps",
       "w:resigned",
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s09b24",
     "shot": "sketch_cheese",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "A",
     "text": "General, the students want change, the unions want raises, and the factories are closed.",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "playful"
    },
    {
     "id": "s09b25",
     "shot": "sketch_cheese",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "B",
     "text": "How can one govern a country that has two hundred and forty-six kinds of cheese?",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pops",
       "w:two",
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "mood": "playful"
    },
    {
     "id": "s09b26",
     "shot": "sketch_cheese",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "A",
     "text": "...Is that a plan?",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "playful"
    },
    {
     "id": "s09b27",
     "shot": "sketch_cheese",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "B",
     "text": "It is a diagnosis.",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "playful"
    },
    {
     "id": "s09b28",
     "shot": "sketch_cheese",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "A",
     "text": "Shall I write it down?",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "playful"
    },
    {
     "id": "s09b29",
     "shot": "sketch_cheese",
     "type": "SKETCH",
     "speaker": "B",
     "text": "Write that it is attributed to me. In sixty years, nobody will check.",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "playful"
    },
    {
     "id": "s09b30",
     "shot": "subscribe2",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Quick pause.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s09b31",
     "shot": "subscribe2",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "If this is the history you wish someone would explain without the jargon,",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s09b32",
     "shot": "subscribe2",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "subscribe, because the second half is where 1789 meets today.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:subscribe,",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    }
   ],
   "mood": "tension"
  }
 ]
}